{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;MusicRunner&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A new type of rhythm action game which you run through music \ud83c\udfb5</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to MusicRunner, a new rhythm and action music game! Run through the world, avoiding obstacles by jumping and moving, while defeating slimes in rhythm.This demo version includes 4 songs and 10 charts. Compete with other players for the highest score on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/extras/ca2dd395a3dc207f2bdd990374eb3971.avif?t=1758241160\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating player action!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies! Attack at the right time to increase your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/extras/adb4bfa7bf298e70705adf1cd604fe9c.poster.avif?t=1758241160\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/extras/adb4bfa7bf298e70705adf1cd604fe9c.webm?t=1758241160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/extras/adb4bfa7bf298e70705adf1cd604fe9c.mp4?t=1758241160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to avoid rocks on the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/extras/90997c986b285f8cccd4f1749d49ad38.poster.avif?t=1758241160\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040770/ext